Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal-trinity, polkit-agent-tde
Description: Flatpak manager for the Trinity Desktop Environment
 tdeflatpak is a graphical application for managing Flatpak on the
 Trinity Desktop Environment (TDE). It uses libflatpak directly and can:
  * list and uninstall installed applications and runtimes
  * search the AppStream catalogs of configured remotes and install apps
  * check for and install updates
  * add (including Flathub), enable/disable and remove remotes
  * remove unused runtimes
  * install .flatpakref files and add .flatpakrepo remotes
 .
 DISCLAIMER: this application was largely "vibe coded" with the help of an
 AI coding assistant. It has not been thoroughly reviewed or tested, may
 contain bugs and can modify the Flatpak installations on your system. It is
 provided as-is, without any warranty. Use it at your own risk.
